{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tormented Story of Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside a crumbling apartment complex, Violet discovers she isn\u2019t just trapped with the dead \u2014 she\u2019s trapped but is it for her protection? Writings stain the walls, a trumpet echoes through the night, and the sun refuses to rise. Every floor hides a nightmare: deranged tenants, rituals, and rooms steeped in unspeakable secrets. As she fights her way down through the building\u2019s suffocating halls, she must uncover why the complex has become a prison of flesh and faith \u2014 and decide if escape is even possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/fb301bd2abc9864bcc24f8fa8e822846.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay That Bleeds Fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just survival \u2014 it\u2019s endurance under fire. Players wield an arsenal of weapons \u2014 handguns, shotguns, rifles, even hidden weapons \u2014 but ammo is scarce and every bullet matters. Combat is intense, brutal, and unforgiving. Between fights, puzzles block the path forward: breaker panels, cryptic notes, and sinister locks tied to apocalyptic prophecy. Each solved puzzle pulls Violet deeper into the madness, where no room feels safe and no hallway is empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/f0cea32cab68c6ac6f075dd3bd1f8f31.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror That Won\u2019t Let Go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step drips with dread. Sudden crashes in the dark, whispers that crawl down the spine, apparitions flickering just out of reach \u2014 the game thrives on atmospheric horror and sharp, merciless jump scares. It\u2019s a story as much about terror as it is about survival: a descent into a haunted world that blends psychological torment with physical monstrosities. Players who love true horror will find themselves gripped by a tale that doesn\u2019t just scare \u2014 it scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/a88512b3d2c0c7e83f868d886bcd98c8.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, Violet isn\u2019t just fighting to survive \u2014 she\u2019s unraveling the truth. Is this a viral outbreak? The dead rising in a plague of flesh? Or the final days written in prophecy? Every sign she uncovers drags her closer to the answer, but also deeper into terror. The apartment is sealed, its tenants already claimed by madness and death. Only by reading the signs, facing the horrors floor by floor, and refusing to break can Violet hope to escape the nightmare that has swallowed everyone inside.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023230?t=1764561802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023230?t=1764561802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/7a58432c1d4ecf033bf3c4f228834d3045677647/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764561802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/7a58432c1d4ecf033bf3c4f228834d3045677647/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764561802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains intense violence, blood and gore, and strong language. It includes disturbing imagery, scenes of murder, and supernatural horror themes.\r\n\r\nSome moments feature suggestive or darkly humorous dialogue intended for mature audiences.\r\n\r\nPlayer discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4166610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tormented Story of Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked inside a crumbling apartment complex, Violet discovers she isn\u2019t just trapped with the dead \u2014 she\u2019s trapped but is it for her protection? Writings stain the walls, a trumpet echoes through the night, and the sun refuses to rise. Every floor hides a nightmare: deranged tenants, rituals, and rooms steeped in unspeakable secrets. As she fights her way down through the building\u2019s suffocating halls, she must uncover why the complex has become a prison of flesh and faith \u2014 and decide if escape is even possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/fb301bd2abc9864bcc24f8fa8e822846.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay That Bleeds Fear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just survival \u2014 it\u2019s endurance under fire. Players wield an arsenal of weapons \u2014 handguns, shotguns, rifles, even hidden weapons \u2014 but ammo is scarce and every bullet matters. Combat is intense, brutal, and unforgiving. Between fights, puzzles block the path forward: breaker panels, cryptic notes, and sinister locks tied to apocalyptic prophecy. Each solved puzzle pulls Violet deeper into the madness, where no room feels safe and no hallway is empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/f0cea32cab68c6ac6f075dd3bd1f8f31.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror That Won\u2019t Let Go</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step drips with dread. Sudden crashes in the dark, whispers that crawl down the spine, apparitions flickering just out of reach \u2014 the game thrives on atmospheric horror and sharp, merciless jump scares. It\u2019s a story as much about terror as it is about survival: a descent into a haunted world that blends psychological torment with physical monstrosities. Players who love true horror will find themselves gripped by a tale that doesn\u2019t just scare \u2014 it scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/extras/a88512b3d2c0c7e83f868d886bcd98c8.avif?t=1764561802\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, Violet isn\u2019t just fighting to survive \u2014 she\u2019s unraveling the truth. Is this a viral outbreak? The dead rising in a plague of flesh? Or the final days written in prophecy? Every sign she uncovers drags her closer to the answer, but also deeper into terror. The apartment is sealed, its tenants already claimed by madness and death. Only by reading the signs, facing the horrors floor by floor, and refusing to break can Violet hope to escape the nightmare that has swallowed everyone inside.</p>","developers":["Renderready, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023230/a60619498f3f439189fff6fc3ac96d72fbc280ff/header.jpg?t=1764561802","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended"